      "title": "Business Operations Coordinator",
      "description": "Be the operational backbone behind Champlain's finance and business operations. Champlain College seeks a Business Operations Coordinator to support the financial, administrative, and operational functions of multiple campus departments, working most closely with Finance and Advancement. You will exercise independent judgment in applying institutional policies and regulatory requirements, safeguard the integrity of financial and donor records, and serve as a trusted resource and liaison for college personnel, vendors, and external partners.",
